WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
She dares

2
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:02,040
One day with me

3
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:04,320
It's not her turn to turn this family upside down, right?

4
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,440
Jiaojiao was brought up by Mother Wang since she was a child.

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,000
I won’t sleep without her in the night market

6
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,520
You are also the eldest brother

7
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,240
Do you want to watch Jiaojiao cry every day?

8
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,080
large-scale

9
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,360
Wang Ma will also change her grandma

10
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:19,060
This is not a question of whether to change it or not.

11
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,850
This matter is settled like this. Mother Wang will stay.

12
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:23,410
But she was fined three months' salary

13
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:24,930
You are not allowed to approach Yoyo again in the future

14
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,600
Thank you sir

15
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,680
Thank you, old lady, I will

16
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,920
I will definitely take better care of Miss Jiaojiao

17
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:40,140
Protect Youyou more from now on. You said she is my sister.

18
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,260
Of course I will protect her

19
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,640
Yoyo also protects her brother

20
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:47,350
You're the only one protecting me, you little brat

21
00:00:47,830 --> 00:00:49,190
He's not as tall as my wheelchair

22
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:54,120
I need you. This is Yoyo.

23
00:00:54,120 --> 00:01:00,640
Do you know how dangerous and stupid it is?

24
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,040
What if you drown?

25
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:06,220
It's just a medal

26
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:07,380
worthless

27
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:12,000
Because this is my brother's glory

28
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:24,250
How could there be such a stupid little idiot brother in the world?

29
00:01:24,410 --> 00:01:25,570
Still telling stories

30
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:28,180
All told

31
00:01:28,540 --> 00:01:31,330
Do all children have this much power?

32
00:01:31,450 --> 00:01:34,140
Youyou doesn’t want to sleep yet

33
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:41,430
Why don't you count the sheep? One sheep, two sheep, brother.

34
00:01:41,590 --> 00:01:43,030
No arms or legs
